  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:small\">[英文]</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>1.8.x 版本的全新 Minecraft 紋理</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:small\">&gt; 包含來自更新版本的所有新方塊、物品和實體紋理</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><u><strong>為 1.8 版增添的實用功能：</strong></u></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">4 種床的顏色 — 取代原本只有 1 種（北=紅，南=綠，東=藍，西=黃）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">更佳的鐵柵欄和玻璃片（採用 1.9+ 版本的模型）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">主選單新增更新主題背景</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">更逼真的雨聲（來自 1.9+ 版本的聲音）</span></li>\n</ul><p><br><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\">下載：</span></span></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f59988283036285\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><u>點我</u></span></span></a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:small\">[德文]</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>Alle neuen Minecraft Texturen in 1.8.x</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:small\">&gt; Enthält alle neuen Block-, Item- und Entity-Texturen aus neueren Versionen</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><u><strong>Fügt außerdem nice Features zur 1.8 hinzu:</strong></u></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">4 Bett Farben - normalerweise nur 1 (Norden=Rot, Süden=Grün, Osten=Blau, Westen=Gelb)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">Bessere Iron Bars und Glass Panes (Wie das 1.9+ Model)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">Neuer themenbasierter Hintergrund im Hauptmenü</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:small\">Bessere Regen Souns (Die Sounds aus der 1.9+)</span></li>\n</ul><p><br><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\">Download:</span></span></strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f59988283036285\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><u>Klick mich</u></span></span></a></p><p><br><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
